I had this problem today. More than one year after, so i think it is no longer useful. It is not possible get the user role in the event: core\event\user_enrolment_created , because Moodle deal with enrolment_created and core\event\role_assigned in different ways. First he create the enrolment, this trigger an event core\event\user_enrolment_created at this point the user role is not defined yet. Than he assign the role to the user, this trigger an event core\event\role_assigned . Probably this is the event you want. This can be seen in the file lib/enrollib.php from line 1321 onward. 
